</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">Other income, net decreased by approximately $0.9 million, or 69.2%, from approximately $1.3 million for the
<span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">year ended December 31, 2023 to approximately $0.4 million for
