    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">a trust if (i) a U.S. court can exercise primary supervision over the trust&#8217;s administration and one or more U.S. persons are authorized to control all substantial decisions of the trust, or (ii) it has a valid election in effect under applicable U.S. Treasury regulations to be treated as a U.S. person.</span></td></tr>
