</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">F. <span style="text-decoration:underline">Dividends and Paying Agents</span></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

