<td style="width: 0.75in"/><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">o</span></td><td style="text-align: justify">the sale, issuance or potential issuance by the company of
common stock (or securities convertible into or exercisable for common stock) at a price less than the greater of book or market value
which together with sales by officers, directors or Substantial Shareholders of the company equals 20% or more of common stock or 20%
or more of the voting power outstanding before the issuance; or</td>
</tr></table><div>

