</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; width: 100%; border-spacing: 0px;"><tr style="vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<td style="width: 0.75in"/><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">o</span></td><td style="text-align: justify">the sale, issuance or potential issuance by the company of
common stock (or securities convertible into or exercisable common stock) equal to 20% or more of the common stock or 20% or more of
