<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Zhongchao Inc. (&#8220;Zhongchao Cayman&#8221;,
or the &#8220;Company&#8221;) is a holding company incorporated on April 16, 2019, under the laws of the Cayman Islands. The Company commenced
operations on August 17, 2012, through its variable interest entity (&#8220;VIE&#8221;), Zhongchao Medical Technology (Shanghai) Limited
(&#8220;Zhongchao Shanghai&#8221;), a limited liability company established under the laws of the PRC. The Company provides customized
medical courses and customized medical training services to pharmaceutical enterprises, and not-for-profit organizations (&#8220;NFPs&#8221;)
including medical associations, medical institutions, medical journals, medical foundations, hospitals and etc. and sales of pharmaceutical
products in the PRC.</p>

