ustify">&#160;</p> <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">In the year of 2022, Mr. Weiguang Yang transferred <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c79" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-26763">6.67</ix:nonFraction>% to four shareholders of West Angel, as a part of consideration to acquire <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c80" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-26764">60</ix:nonFraction>% equity interest in West Angel. Shanghai Zhongxun owns <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c81" decimals="4" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentOwnershipPercentage" scale="-2" unitRef="pure" id="ixv-26765">93.33</ix:nonFraction>% of Shanghai Zhongxin&#8217;s equity interest as of December 31, 2022.</p></ix:footnote></td></tr> </table></ix:continuation>
