purchased from two existing shareholders), and to contribute the same amount of capital to Zhongchao Cayman directly. The Company and
HF Capital Management Delta, Inc. (&#8220;HF Capital&#8221;), the sole member of which was the managing partner of Yantai HF, entered
into a certain warrant agreement to purchase ordinary shares of the Company, pursuant to which the Company granted a warrant to HF Capital,
who expects to exercise the warrant and receive the ordinary shares of the Company before the effective date and closing of the offering
because these conditions are considered to be administrative procedures and there are no uncertainties of going through them. The warrant
