</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:continuation id="_VariableInterestEntityDisclosureTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" escape="true" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfVariableInterestEntitiesTextBlock" id="ixv-21695"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The following significant amounts of Zhongchao Shanghai and its subsidiaries
are included in the accompanying consolidated financial statements as of December 31, 2025 and 2024, and for the years ended December
31, 2025, 2024 and 2023:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-spacing: 0px;">
