shares of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c246" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:WeightedAverageNumberOfSharesContingentlyIssuable" scale="0" unitRef="shares" id="ixv-27160">16,876</ix:nonFraction> shares of Class A ordinary share underlying the warrant (Note 1) issued to one existing shareholder of Zhongchao Shanghai
is included in calculation of basic and diluted weighted average number of ordinary share outstanding, as the Company does not expect
any circumstances under which those shares would not be issued.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

