<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On December 12, 2024, the Company issued an aggregate
of <ix:nonFraction contextRef="c264" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodValueStockOptionsExercised" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27186">1,200,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A Ordinary Shares to the Purchasers upon cashless exercise of the Warrants, pursuant to the terms of the Warrants (the
