of profit-making PRC subsidiaries, VIE or VIE&#8217;s subsidiaries as of December 31, 2025, 2024 and 2023, respectively. During the year
ended December 31, 2025, the Company recorded a reversal of statutory reserve of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c0" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zcmd:ReversalOfStatutoryReserve" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27199">141,513</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c14" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zcmd:ReversalOfStatutoryReserve" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27200">113,186</ix:nonFraction> of the discontinued subsidiaries,
respectively. As of December&#160;31, 2025 and 2024, the Company had statutory reserve of $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c4" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zcmd:StatutoryReserveFunds" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27201">1,340,331</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c5" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="zcmd:StatutoryReserveFunds" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27202">1,419,190</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">As of December 31, 2025 and 2024, the Company
