<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Substantially all of the Company&#8217;s revenues
are derived from China based on the geographical locations where services are provided to customers. In addition, the Company&#8217;s
long-lived assets are substantially all located in and derived from China, and the amount of long-lived assets attributable to any individual
other country is not material. Therefore, no geographical segments are presented.</p></ix:continuation><div>

