cash payment for amounts included in the measurement of lease liabilities was $<span style="-sec-ix-hidden: hidden-fact-221">nil</span>, $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c14" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27394">249,133</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c15" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLeasePayments" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-27395">427,278</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p></ix:continuation><div>

